{"id":"vol9-06","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-06/audio-4.m4a","model":"small","duration":362.58,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":7.68,"text":"Part 4. You will hear part of a lecture about archaeological research in the Patagonia region","words":[["Part",0.0,0.24],["4.",0.24,0.66],["You",1.92,2.2],["will",2.2,2.38],["hear",2.38,2.68],["part",2.68,3.04],["of",3.04,3.2],["a",3.2,3.34],["lecture",3.34,3.62],["about",3.62,4.32],["archaeological",4.32,4.98],["research",4.98,5.84],["in",5.84,6.38],["the",6.38,6.5],["Patagonia",6.5,7.26],["region",7.26,7.68]]},{"start":7.68,"end":65.57,"text":"of South America. First, you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40. Now, listen carefully","words":[["of",7.68,8.0],["South",8.0,8.26],["America.",8.26,8.78],["First,",10.0,10.6],["you",10.76,10.82],["have",10.82,10.98],["some",10.98,11.16],["time",11.16,11.54],["to",11.54,11.78],["look",11.78,11.94],["at",11.94,12.08],["questions",12.08,12.4],["31",12.4,13.24],["to",13.24,13.54],["40.",13.54,13.92],["Now,",64.53,64.81],["listen",64.87,65.15],["carefully",65.15,65.57]]},{"start":65.57,"end":68.17,"text":"and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["and",65.57,65.93],["answer",65.93,66.27],["questions",66.27,66.69],["31",66.69,67.49],["to",67.49,67.81],["40.",67.81,68.17]]},{"start":71.66,"end":77.5,"text":"Good afternoon, everyone. Welcome to today's archaeology lecture. This afternoon's topic","words":[["Good",71.66,72.12],["afternoon,",72.12,72.3],["everyone.",72.4,72.66],["Welcome",73.52,73.82],["to",73.82,74.06],["today's",74.06,74.48],["archaeology",74.48,75.16],["lecture.",75.16,75.52],["This",76.46,76.74],["afternoon's",76.74,77.28],["topic",77.28,77.5]]},{"start":77.5,"end":81.5,"text":"will be the Patagon civilization that flourished at the southern tip of the South American","words":[["will",77.5,77.72],["be",77.72,77.84],["the",77.84,78.0],["Patagon",78.0,78.4],["civilization",78.4,79.0],["that",79.0,79.52],["flourished",79.52,79.92],["at",79.92,80.06],["the",80.06,80.18],["southern",80.18,80.48],["tip",80.48,80.7],["of",80.7,80.84],["the",80.84,80.96],["South",80.96,81.2],["American",81.2,81.5]]},{"start":81.5,"end":87.28,"text":"continent around 600 years ago. Now archaeologists don't know a great deal","words":[["continent",81.5,82.12],["around",82.12,82.86],["600",82.86,83.26],["years",83.26,83.68],["ago.",83.68,83.98],["Now",85.16,85.38],["archaeologists",85.38,86.22],["don't",86.22,86.56],["know",86.56,86.72],["a",86.72,86.82],["great",86.82,87.08],["deal",87.08,87.28]]},{"start":87.28,"end":91.84,"text":"about the Patagon people, however they did leave behind one important piece of","words":[["about",87.28,87.56],["the",87.56,87.72],["Patagon",87.72,88.06],["people,",88.06,88.4],["however",88.84,89.26],["they",89.26,89.78],["did",89.78,90.02],["leave",90.02,90.16],["behind",90.16,90.52],["one",90.52,90.92],["important",90.92,91.38],["piece",91.38,91.64],["of",91.64,91.84]]},{"start":91.84,"end":96.14,"text":"evidence, a type of coat that was worn over the body for warmth that gives us","words":[["evidence,",91.84,92.2],["a",92.74,92.84],["type",92.84,93.04],["of",93.04,93.18],["coat",93.18,93.46],["that",93.46,93.72],["was",93.72,93.88],["worn",93.88,94.22],["over",94.22,94.52],["the",94.52,94.66],["body",94.66,94.92],["for",94.92,95.12],["warmth",95.12,95.52],["that",95.52,95.78],["gives",95.78,95.98],["us",95.98,96.14]]},{"start":96.14,"end":100.76,"text":"valuable information about this lost culture. The coat was made from the","words":[["valuable",96.14,96.58],["information",96.58,97.1],["about",97.1,97.64],["this",97.64,97.94],["lost",97.94,98.2],["culture.",98.2,98.62],["The",99.38,99.62],["coat",99.62,99.9],["was",99.9,100.14],["made",100.14,100.36],["from",100.36,100.56],["the",100.56,100.76]]},{"start":100.76,"end":105.9,"text":"fur of the guanaco, that's a wild animal like a goat, and it took as many as 13","words":[["fur",100.76,100.96],["of",100.96,101.14],["the",101.14,101.26],["guanaco,",101.26,101.72],["that's",102.18,102.6],["a",102.6,102.68],["wild",102.68,102.84],["animal",102.84,103.16],["like",103.16,103.48],["a",103.48,103.62],["goat,",103.62,103.82],["and",104.28,104.58],["it",104.58,104.7],["took",104.7,104.82],["as",104.82,104.96],["many",104.96,105.18],["as",105.18,105.38],["13",105.38,105.9]]},{"start":105.9,"end":110.64,"text":"young guanaco to make a single coat. Young animals were preferred as their","words":[["young",105.9,106.3],["guanaco",106.3,106.8],["to",106.8,107.06],["make",107.06,107.24],["a",107.24,107.4],["single",107.4,107.66],["coat.",107.66,108.06],["Young",108.9,109.2],["animals",109.2,109.56],["were",109.56,109.78],["preferred",109.78,110.14],["as",110.14,110.46],["their",110.46,110.64]]},{"start":110.64,"end":116.88,"text":"skin was soft, which made it easy to work with. For the Patagon men, hunting was a way of life,","words":[["skin",110.64,110.9],["was",110.9,111.1],["soft,",111.1,111.5],["which",111.7,111.82],["made",111.82,112.02],["it",112.02,112.14],["easy",112.14,112.42],["to",112.42,112.64],["work",112.64,112.88],["with.",112.88,113.1],["For",114.1,114.42],["the",114.42,114.52],["Patagon",114.52,114.86],["men,",114.86,115.2],["hunting",115.72,115.94],["was",115.94,116.24],["a",116.24,116.36],["way",116.36,116.48],["of",116.48,116.6],["life,",116.6,116.88]]},{"start":117.08,"end":122.72,"text":"particularly hunting Guernaco. However, once the animals were killed, then different skills were","words":[["particularly",117.08,117.6],["hunting",117.6,117.96],["Guernaco.",117.96,118.52],["However,",119.46,119.82],["once",120.24,120.52],["the",120.52,120.72],["animals",120.72,120.96],["were",120.96,121.2],["killed,",121.2,121.52],["then",121.7,121.8],["different",121.8,122.14],["skills",122.14,122.46],["were",122.46,122.72]]},{"start":122.72,"end":126.7,"text":"needed and it was the woman who were mostly responsible for the manufacturing process.","words":[["needed",122.72,123.06],["and",123.06,123.34],["it",123.34,123.42],["was",123.42,123.56],["the",123.56,123.68],["woman",123.68,123.92],["who",123.92,124.18],["were",124.18,124.32],["mostly",124.32,124.62],["responsible",124.62,125.18],["for",125.18,125.44],["the",125.44,125.56],["manufacturing",125.56,126.16],["process.",126.16,126.7]]},{"start":127.98,"end":132.92,"text":"In particular, it was their ability to sew together many small skins into a coat that","words":[["In",127.98,128.5],["particular,",128.5,128.88],["it",129.44,129.52],["was",129.52,129.64],["their",129.64,129.78],["ability",129.78,130.08],["to",130.08,130.32],["sew",130.32,130.58],["together",130.58,130.92],["many",130.92,131.26],["small",131.26,131.58],["skins",131.58,131.96],["into",131.96,132.24],["a",132.24,132.44],["coat",132.44,132.68],["that",132.68,132.92]]},{"start":132.92,"end":139.36,"text":"made women integral to the process. So, the first thing they did was get the skins ready,","words":[["made",132.92,133.1],["women",133.1,133.44],["integral",133.44,134.0],["to",134.0,134.22],["the",134.22,134.3],["process.",134.3,134.7],["So,",136.26,136.78],["the",137.22,137.5],["first",137.5,137.7],["thing",137.7,137.88],["they",137.88,138.0],["did",138.0,138.18],["was",138.18,138.38],["get",138.38,138.54],["the",138.54,138.68],["skins",138.68,139.0],["ready,",139.0,139.36]]},{"start":139.36,"end":141.64,"text":"and for this they used a special scraper tool.","words":[["and",139.36,139.62],["for",139.62,139.8],["this",139.8,139.96],["they",139.96,140.14],["used",140.14,140.3],["a",140.3,140.44],["special",140.44,140.8],["scraper",140.8,141.36],["tool.",141.36,141.64]]},{"start":142.5,"end":147.14,"text":"Several examples of the scrapers may still be seen today in various museums in the region.","words":[["Several",142.5,143.02],["examples",143.02,143.46],["of",143.46,143.7],["the",143.7,143.82],["scrapers",143.82,144.22],["may",144.22,144.38],["still",144.38,144.68],["be",144.68,144.84],["seen",144.84,145.1],["today",145.1,145.42],["in",145.42,145.64],["various",145.64,145.98],["museums",145.98,146.5],["in",146.5,146.74],["the",146.74,146.82],["region.",146.82,147.14]]},{"start":148.16,"end":152.34,"text":"They were constructed from specially sharpened stones so have survived remarkably well.","words":[["They",148.16,148.32],["were",148.32,148.44],["constructed",148.44,148.86],["from",148.86,149.12],["specially",149.12,149.62],["sharpened",149.62,150.24],["stones",150.24,150.54],["so",150.54,150.78],["have",150.78,150.92],["survived",150.92,151.34],["remarkably",151.34,151.96],["well.",151.96,152.34]]},{"start":153.84,"end":158.98,"text":"Once the skins were clean, they were usually decorated, usually done by painting on colours,","words":[["Once",153.84,154.14],["the",154.14,154.34],["skins",154.34,154.48],["were",154.48,154.72],["clean,",154.72,155.04],["they",155.48,155.58],["were",155.58,155.68],["usually",155.68,155.98],["decorated,",155.98,156.7],["usually",157.22,157.58],["done",157.58,157.84],["by",157.84,158.04],["painting",158.04,158.38],["on",158.38,158.58],["colours,",158.58,158.98]]},{"start":159.34,"end":162.6,"text":"mostly some combination of red, yellow and green.","words":[["mostly",159.34,159.7],["some",159.7,160.04],["combination",160.04,160.48],["of",160.48,160.88],["red,",160.88,161.18],["yellow",161.6,161.9],["and",161.9,162.32],["green.",162.32,162.6]]},{"start":163.64,"end":167.64,"text":"The colours themselves occurred naturally in minerals that were dug up from the ground","words":[["The",163.64,163.92],["colours",163.92,164.14],["themselves",164.14,164.56],["occurred",164.56,165.1],["naturally",165.1,165.64],["in",165.64,165.82],["minerals",165.82,166.14],["that",166.14,166.52],["were",166.52,166.64],["dug",166.64,166.88],["up",166.88,167.04],["from",167.04,167.24],["the",167.24,167.38],["ground",167.38,167.64]]},{"start":167.64,"end":174.22,"text":"and processed, usually by mixing with water. This basically was the way the Patagon people made","words":[["and",167.64,167.84],["processed,",167.84,168.26],["usually",168.82,169.22],["by",169.22,169.52],["mixing",169.52,169.82],["with",169.82,170.06],["water.",170.06,170.4],["This",171.58,172.02],["basically",172.02,172.54],["was",172.54,172.8],["the",172.8,172.96],["way",172.96,173.08],["the",173.08,173.24],["Patagon",173.24,173.6],["people",173.6,173.9],["made",173.9,174.22]]},{"start":174.22,"end":181.06,"text":"coats for, well, over a thousand years and perhaps longer, but the process changed dramatically","words":[["coats",174.22,174.52],["for,",174.52,174.9],["well,",175.14,175.54],["over",176.18,176.4],["a",176.4,176.58],["thousand",176.58,176.8],["years",176.8,177.18],["and",177.18,177.42],["perhaps",177.42,177.72],["longer,",177.72,178.12],["but",178.9,179.48],["the",179.48,179.58],["process",179.58,179.88],["changed",179.88,180.38],["dramatically",180.38,181.06]]},{"start":181.06,"end":187.46,"text":"after the Spanish arrived in the early 1500s. The coming of the Spanish obviously had numerous","words":[["after",181.06,181.42],["the",181.42,181.62],["Spanish",181.62,181.9],["arrived",181.9,182.4],["in",182.4,182.64],["the",182.64,182.74],["early",182.74,182.96],["1500s.",182.96,184.1],["The",185.24,185.42],["coming",185.42,185.6],["of",185.6,185.76],["the",185.76,185.86],["Spanish",185.86,186.18],["obviously",186.18,186.72],["had",186.72,187.08],["numerous",187.08,187.46]]},{"start":187.46,"end":193.3,"text":"impacts on the area, but in terms of coat making there was one significant development in the","words":[["impacts",187.46,187.96],["on",187.96,188.22],["the",188.22,188.36],["area,",188.36,188.68],["but",189.22,189.86],["in",189.86,190.0],["terms",190.0,190.22],["of",190.22,190.4],["coat",190.4,190.66],["making",190.66,190.9],["there",190.9,191.18],["was",191.18,191.34],["one",191.34,191.58],["significant",191.58,192.26],["development",192.26,192.86],["in",192.86,193.16],["the",193.16,193.3]]},{"start":193.3,"end":198.88,"text":"hunting technique. Many more Guanaco were hunted after the introduction of the horse to the","words":[["hunting",193.3,193.58],["technique.",193.58,194.02],["Many",195.16,195.66],["more",195.66,195.92],["Guanaco",195.92,196.38],["were",196.38,196.7],["hunted",196.7,196.96],["after",196.96,197.36],["the",197.36,197.52],["introduction",197.52,197.94],["of",197.94,198.18],["the",198.18,198.3],["horse",198.3,198.56],["to",198.56,198.78],["the",198.78,198.88]]},{"start":198.88,"end":204.32,"text":"region, which made the Patagon people more mobile. Another important development was","words":[["region,",198.88,199.18],["which",199.44,199.68],["made",199.68,199.86],["the",199.86,200.02],["Patagon",200.02,200.34],["people",200.34,200.66],["more",200.66,200.92],["mobile.",200.92,201.38],["Another",202.72,203.08],["important",203.08,203.58],["development",203.58,203.98],["was",203.98,204.32]]},{"start":204.32,"end":208.92,"text":"that the Spanish themselves, liked, were great admirers of the coats and bought them for","words":[["that",204.32,204.48],["the",204.48,204.62],["Spanish",204.62,204.88],["themselves,",204.88,205.42],["liked,",205.68,205.98],["were",206.48,206.78],["great",206.78,207.06],["admirers",207.06,207.58],["of",207.58,207.72],["the",207.72,207.84],["coats",207.84,208.04],["and",208.04,208.26],["bought",208.26,208.56],["them",208.56,208.74],["for",208.74,208.92]]},{"start":208.92,"end":214.96,"text":"high prices. So that while in the past Guanaco had only been hunted to meet subsistence","words":[["high",208.92,209.22],["prices.",209.22,209.74],["So",210.58,211.14],["that",211.14,211.26],["while",211.26,211.44],["in",211.44,211.7],["the",211.7,211.8],["past",211.8,212.12],["Guanaco",212.12,212.72],["had",212.72,213.0],["only",213.0,213.32],["been",213.32,213.52],["hunted",213.52,213.82],["to",213.82,214.04],["meet",214.04,214.16],["subsistence",214.16,214.96]]},{"start":214.96,"end":220.5,"text":"needs, now the coats were increasingly part of a commercial process. I mean something","words":[["needs,",214.96,215.28],["now",216.04,216.26],["the",216.26,216.42],["coats",216.42,216.66],["were",216.66,216.88],["increasingly",216.88,217.4],["part",217.4,217.84],["of",217.84,218.04],["a",218.04,218.12],["commercial",218.12,218.52],["process.",218.52,219.06],["I",219.96,220.14],["mean",220.14,220.26],["something",220.26,220.5]]},{"start":220.5,"end":225.46,"text":"that could be bought and sold for money and that meant many more guinaco were","words":[["that",220.5,220.66],["could",220.66,220.8],["be",220.8,220.94],["bought",220.94,221.18],["and",221.18,221.34],["sold",221.34,221.56],["for",221.56,221.74],["money",221.74,221.98],["and",221.98,223.78],["that",223.78,223.94],["meant",223.94,224.14],["many",224.14,224.5],["more",224.5,224.72],["guinaco",224.72,225.2],["were",225.2,225.46]]},{"start":225.46,"end":230.62,"text":"hunted as well. Finally the manufacturing process itself was changed by","words":[["hunted",225.46,225.7],["as",225.7,225.94],["well.",225.94,226.38],["Finally",227.32,227.84],["the",227.84,228.26],["manufacturing",228.26,228.82],["process",228.82,229.32],["itself",229.32,229.8],["was",229.8,230.04],["changed",230.04,230.38],["by",230.38,230.62]]},{"start":230.62,"end":234.88,"text":"the arrival of the Spanish. That's because they bought many new materials with","words":[["the",230.62,230.76],["arrival",230.76,231.12],["of",231.12,231.3],["the",231.3,231.38],["Spanish.",231.38,231.7],["That's",232.34,232.8],["because",232.8,233.02],["they",233.02,233.26],["bought",233.26,233.5],["many",233.5,233.9],["new",233.9,234.12],["materials",234.12,234.64],["with",234.64,234.88]]},{"start":234.88,"end":239.42,"text":"them that weren't previously known in the region. Most important for coat making","words":[["them",234.88,235.04],["that",235.04,235.18],["weren't",235.18,235.48],["previously",235.48,235.96],["known",235.96,236.36],["in",236.36,236.54],["the",236.54,236.64],["region.",236.64,236.96],["Most",237.78,238.3],["important",238.3,238.72],["for",238.72,238.94],["coat",238.94,239.16],["making",239.16,239.42]]},{"start":239.42,"end":244.02,"text":"the old scrapers used for cleaning the skins were replaced with new ones made","words":[["the",239.42,240.18],["old",240.18,240.5],["scrapers",240.5,241.14],["used",241.14,241.36],["for",241.36,241.54],["cleaning",241.54,241.9],["the",241.9,242.16],["skins",242.16,242.36],["were",242.36,242.7],["replaced",242.7,243.0],["with",243.0,243.26],["new",243.26,243.5],["ones",243.5,243.78],["made",243.78,244.02]]},{"start":244.02,"end":253.47,"text":"from glass and this was more effective and easier to keep sharp. So what","words":[["from",244.02,244.24],["glass",244.24,244.6],["and",244.6,244.84],["this",244.84,244.98],["was",244.98,245.2],["more",245.2,245.92],["effective",245.92,246.34],["and",246.34,246.68],["easier",246.68,246.98],["to",246.98,247.2],["keep",247.2,247.38],["sharp.",247.38,247.74],["So",252.99,253.29],["what",253.29,253.47]]},{"start":253.47,"end":255.65,"text":"What conclusions can we draw from Patagon coats?","words":[["What",253.47,253.47],["conclusions",253.47,253.97],["can",253.97,254.33],["we",254.33,254.45],["draw",254.45,254.69],["from",254.69,254.93],["Patagon",254.93,255.35],["coats?",255.35,255.65]]},{"start":256.43,"end":261.03,"text":"Well, the striking designs that were painted onto many of the more elaborate coats have","words":[["Well,",256.43,256.69],["the",257.29,257.49],["striking",257.49,257.79],["designs",257.79,258.29],["that",258.29,258.51],["were",258.51,258.61],["painted",258.61,258.91],["onto",258.91,259.13],["many",259.13,259.53],["of",259.53,259.71],["the",259.71,259.83],["more",259.83,260.01],["elaborate",260.01,260.45],["coats",260.45,260.83],["have",260.83,261.03]]},{"start":261.03,"end":262.81,"text":"always fascinated archaeologists.","words":[["always",261.03,261.29],["fascinated",261.29,261.85],["archaeologists.",261.85,262.81]]},{"start":263.73,"end":267.53,"text":"These patterns must have their origins far back in prehistoric times.","words":[["These",263.73,264.19],["patterns",264.19,264.53],["must",264.53,264.83],["have",264.83,265.07],["their",265.07,265.25],["origins",265.25,265.57],["far",265.57,266.03],["back",266.03,266.37],["in",266.37,266.53],["prehistoric",266.53,267.15],["times.",267.15,267.53]]},{"start":268.27,"end":272.49,"text":"We are able to say this with some confidence because very similar designs have been found","words":[["We",268.27,268.55],["are",268.55,268.65],["able",268.65,268.87],["to",268.87,268.99],["say",268.99,269.21],["this",269.21,269.39],["with",269.39,269.53],["some",269.53,269.73],["confidence",269.73,270.21],["because",270.21,270.61],["very",270.61,270.99],["similar",270.99,271.37],["designs",271.37,271.85],["have",271.85,272.05],["been",272.05,272.21],["found",272.21,272.49]]},{"start":272.49,"end":277.25,"text":"in examples of art painted on the rock walls of caves that have very ancient origins.","words":[["in",272.49,272.73],["examples",272.73,273.09],["of",273.09,273.37],["art",273.37,273.73],["painted",273.73,274.17],["on",274.17,274.41],["the",274.41,274.53],["rock",274.53,274.77],["walls",274.77,275.05],["of",275.05,275.27],["caves",275.27,275.61],["that",275.61,275.89],["have",275.89,276.05],["very",276.05,276.33],["ancient",276.33,276.75],["origins.",276.75,277.25]]},{"start":277.25,"end":284.23,"text":"designs. Did the designs have any significance, or were they merely decorations? The answer","words":[["designs.",277.25,278.05],["Did",278.23,278.91],["the",278.91,279.03],["designs",279.03,279.37],["have",279.37,279.69],["any",279.69,279.99],["significance,",279.99,280.61],["or",281.03,281.31],["were",281.31,281.57],["they",281.57,281.73],["merely",281.73,282.07],["decorations?",282.07,282.69],["The",283.71,283.97],["answer",283.97,284.23]]},{"start":284.23,"end":289.67,"text":"isn't clear, but some archaeologists have been prepared to speculate. One possibility","words":[["isn't",284.23,284.53],["clear,",284.53,284.87],["but",285.21,285.35],["some",285.35,285.67],["archaeologists",285.67,286.45],["have",286.45,286.87],["been",286.87,287.07],["prepared",287.07,287.43],["to",287.43,287.63],["speculate.",287.63,287.91],["One",288.95,289.21],["possibility",289.21,289.67]]},{"start":289.67,"end":294.45,"text":"is that the designs may have represented a way of connecting with ancestors from previous","words":[["is",289.67,290.09],["that",290.09,290.23],["the",290.23,290.33],["designs",290.33,290.73],["may",290.73,291.11],["have",291.11,291.33],["represented",291.33,291.89],["a",291.89,292.07],["way",292.07,292.23],["of",292.23,292.35],["connecting",292.35,292.69],["with",292.69,292.91],["ancestors",292.91,293.61],["from",293.61,293.97],["previous",293.97,294.45]]},{"start":294.45,"end":301.01,"text":"times, and this is certainly an idea that deserves further investigation. Another interesting","words":[["times,",294.45,294.87],["and",295.43,295.59],["this",295.59,295.73],["is",295.73,295.85],["certainly",295.85,296.19],["an",296.19,296.37],["idea",296.37,296.67],["that",296.67,296.87],["deserves",296.87,297.17],["further",297.17,297.65],["investigation.",297.65,298.45],["Another",300.01,300.43],["interesting",300.43,301.01]]},{"start":301.01,"end":307.89,"text":"speculation concerns the location of large Patagon settlements. Because the natural habitat","words":[["speculation",301.01,301.55],["concerns",301.55,302.03],["the",302.03,302.35],["location",302.35,302.97],["of",302.97,303.21],["large",303.21,303.51],["Patagon",303.51,303.97],["settlements.",303.97,304.35],["Because",305.45,305.69],["the",305.69,306.03],["natural",306.03,307.33],["habitat",307.33,307.89]]},{"start":307.89,"end":313.49,"text":"of the young guanaco was the rich grasslands of inland areas, it seems unlikely that these","words":[["of",307.89,308.15],["the",308.15,308.27],["young",308.27,308.49],["guanaco",308.49,308.95],["was",308.95,309.29],["the",309.29,309.47],["rich",309.47,309.73],["grasslands",309.73,310.51],["of",310.51,310.69],["inland",310.69,310.85],["areas,",310.85,311.47],["it",312.13,312.29],["seems",312.29,312.57],["unlikely",312.57,312.99],["that",312.99,313.31],["these",313.31,313.49]]},{"start":313.49,"end":317.01,"text":"were constructed around the coast, but rather in parts of the interior.","words":[["were",313.49,313.65],["constructed",313.65,314.15],["around",314.15,314.45],["the",314.45,314.63],["coast,",314.63,314.99],["but",315.31,315.49],["rather",315.49,315.79],["in",315.79,316.03],["parts",316.03,316.31],["of",316.31,316.51],["the",316.51,316.61],["interior.",316.61,317.01]]},{"start":318.51,"end":323.37,"text":"Finally, we should note that the traditional art of coat making has long since been lost","words":[["Finally,",318.51,319.11],["we",319.57,319.75],["should",319.75,320.01],["note",320.01,320.25],["that",320.25,320.43],["the",320.43,320.53],["traditional",320.53,320.97],["art",320.97,321.27],["of",321.27,321.39],["coat",321.39,321.65],["making",321.65,321.89],["has",321.89,322.23],["long",322.23,322.53],["since",322.53,322.79],["been",322.79,323.07],["lost",323.07,323.37]]},{"start":323.37,"end":328.51,"text":"in this region. But Patagon shepherds today do still employ some of the same techniques","words":[["in",323.37,323.55],["this",323.55,323.69],["region.",323.69,324.03],["But",324.55,324.95],["Patagon",324.95,325.39],["shepherds",325.39,325.85],["today",325.85,326.11],["do",326.11,326.39],["still",326.39,326.77],["employ",326.77,327.21],["some",327.21,327.49],["of",327.49,327.59],["the",327.59,327.69],["same",327.69,327.95],["techniques",327.95,328.51]]},{"start":328.51,"end":332.45,"text":"to make blankets in the winter months, though there is no painting or design","words":[["to",328.51,328.69],["make",328.69,328.87],["blankets",328.87,329.33],["in",329.33,329.65],["the",329.65,329.75],["winter",329.75,329.95],["months,",329.95,330.33],["though",330.63,331.05],["there",331.05,331.17],["is",331.17,331.29],["no",331.29,331.45],["painting",331.45,331.83],["or",331.83,332.07],["design",332.07,332.45]]},{"start":332.45,"end":337.51,"text":"work involved. Well, that is the end of my lecture, but if you have any questions,","words":[["work",332.45,332.73],["involved.",332.73,333.11],["Well,",334.19,334.63],["that",335.07,335.35],["is",335.35,335.45],["the",335.45,335.57],["end",335.57,335.67],["of",335.67,335.75],["my",335.75,335.85],["lecture,",335.85,336.19],["but",336.41,336.47],["if",336.47,336.59],["you",336.59,336.69],["have",336.69,336.91],["any",336.91,337.03],["questions,",337.03,337.51]]},{"start":337.81,"end":338.83,"text":"please feel free to...","words":[["please",337.81,337.97],["feel",337.97,338.27],["free",338.27,338.51],["to...",338.51,338.83]]},{"start":341.97,"end":348.01,"text":"That is the end of Part 4. You now have one minute to check your answers to Part 4.","words":[["That",341.97,342.31],["is",342.31,342.47],["the",342.47,342.63],["end",342.63,343.01],["of",343.01,343.15],["Part",343.15,343.35],["4.",343.35,343.77],["You",344.63,344.83],["now",344.83,345.09],["have",345.09,345.37],["one",345.37,345.67],["minute",345.67,346.05],["to",346.05,346.31],["check",346.31,346.61],["your",346.61,346.81],["answers",346.81,347.19],["to",347.19,347.41],["Part",347.41,347.61],["4.",347.61,348.01]]}]}